        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.811,
            0.22,
            0.915,
            0.268
          ],
          "content": "**Interdisciplinary Projects**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.375,
            0.744,
            0.47
          ],
          "content": "z Study the different parts of a macro fungus mushroom using a magnifying glass and microscope. Take the help of students from senior classes and explore the internal structure of different parts of mushrooms under the microscope in your school laboratory."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.473,
            0.743,
            0.512
          ],
          "content": "z Interact with an entrepreneur and learn the steps for cultivation of mushroom."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.82,
            0.544,
            0.866
          ],
          "content": "**Reflect on the questions framed by your** friends and try to answer"
